@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
|Manager|
start
:Open Management Reporting Dashboard;
:Select Report Type (Sales, Hub Workload, Delivery Performance);
:Input Date Range (startDate, endDate) & Hub/Brand Filters;
|OFDH System|
if (startDate <= endDate?) then (No)
  :Display Invalid Date Range Error;
  stop
else (Yes)
  :Query Order, Hub, and Shipper Records;
endif
if (Matching Records Found?) then (No)
  :Display "No Data Available for Selected Filters";
  stop
else (Yes)
  :Aggregate Revenue, Peak Utilization %, & Avg Delivery Time;
  :Save ManagementReport Snapshot (State = Generated);
  :Render Charts & Summary Tables;
endif
|Manager|
:Review Report Analytics;
if (Export or Archive?) then (Export PDF/CSV)
  |OFDH System|
  :Generate Export File (State = Exported);
elseif (Archive?) then (Archive)
  |OFDH System|
  :Mark Report Snapshot Archived;
else (Close)
endif
stop
@enduml